{"id":"ea75cdbec811405b","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-set.md","title":"集合论元语言的对象","display":"df-set — 集合论元语言的对象","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-set","aliases":["18-df-set"],"display":"df-set — 集合论元语言的对象","depends_on":[],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"3.1–3.2 (background choice)","source_printed_pages":"19–20","source_pdf_pages":"29–30","source_correspondence":"explicit-metatheory-choice","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-set — 集合论元语言的对象"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.1–3.2 (background choice)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"19–20"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"29–30"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"explicit-metatheory-choice"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本笔记元理论为一类对象的一阶 ZFC，其对象变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 只取集合值；可定义类仅为元语言缩写，不把真类作为对象量化。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Set}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Set}_S\\)</span> 是下式引入的冗余集合谓词，索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 没有改变对象论域。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Set}_S(x)\\longleftrightarrow x=x.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Set}_S(x)\\longleftrightarrow x=x.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §3.1 以朴素集合/类语言工作。本节点选择 ZFC 加保守类缩写作为明确的支撑元理论；这不是对原书“set iff member of a class”的逐字定义，也不允许把 Ord 当成集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Set}_S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Set}_S(x)\\longleftrightarrow x=x.","display":true}],"bytes":1135,"backlinks":[{"id":"779baa2ce0d8c0d8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"集合与可定义类的元理论取 [[18-df-set]]；类函数参数为该元理论的公式模式参数，不是集合量词的取值。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-set]]"},{"id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ 为下式引入的一元序数谓词；$a$ 为集合变量，集合语境见 [[18-df-set]]；$\\mathrm{Trans}$ 见 [[18-df-transitive-set]]。"},{"id":"9ac3a6265513490d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S,C,F_n,R_n$ 为 [[18-df-variable]] 的固定签名分量；集合元语言见 [[18-df-set]]。"},{"id":"ca728af2af9b9d11","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"元理论为 [[18-df-set]] 的 ZFC。$V,C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1}$ 是集合，所有符号分量两两不交；$v:\\omega\\to V$ 为双射。$S=\\langle V,C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1},v\\rangle$ 是签名。$\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle$ 为 Kuratowski 有序对，有限列以定义域为有限序数的函数表示。以下带数值标签的构造子生成有限语法树。"},{"id":"b63d92760bb408d3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"元理论为集合论，$M$ 为集合变量；$\\mathrm{Trans},\\operatorname{Tran}$ 是下式引入的同义谓词，集合语境见 [[18-df-set]]。"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-set]]"}],"outgoing":[]}